From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: thanhan92-f1 <thanhan92-f1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 09:49:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(connectors): add Vietnamese payment connectors

Adds MoMo, VNPAY, ZaloPay, Viettel Money, payOS, SePay and Pay2S:
- momo: e-wallet (captureWallet) and ATM card redirect, query, refund, IPN
- vnpay: locally signed payment URL (VNPAY-QR / bank page), querydr, refund, GET IPN
- zalopay: order create (VietQR / gateway), query, refund + refund query, callback
- viettelmoney: locally signed gateway URL, IPN and signed return verification
- payos: VietQR payment links, status query, cancel, signed webhooks
- sepay: local VietQR + bank transaction reconciliation via API and webhooks
- pay2s: local VietQR + bank transaction webhooks

Registers the connectors across enums, routing, configs, dashboard connector
configs, pm_filters and router test scaffolding.

